sentences.text:
In view of the above, I make the following direction:
(i) Writ petition succeeds; a Writ of Certiorari issues quashing the BDA endorsement and the Government Letter dated 21.05.2021;
(ii) a Writ of Mandamus issues to the respondent-BDA to consider petitioners representation;
(iii) Liberty is reserved to the petitioners to apply for the benefit of Sec. 69 of the Act within a period of four weeks and once it has been so applied, the respondent BDA shall consider the same afresh within a period of three months which shall include all the intermediary stages;
All contentions are kept open.

